      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><h2 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\">What is the <span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"ea4e78a2-8858-4109-9c22-93c5e8178917\">purpose</span>?</h2></div>",
          "layout": {
            "mobile": {
              "area": "1/2/3/10",
              "zIndex": 1,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            },
            "desktop": {
              "area": "1/7/3/20",
              "zIndex": 1,
              "justify": "flex-start",
              "align": "flex-start"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<div><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">The project aims to create a more inclusive and democratic Europe by encouraging citizens to </span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"d0c62337-1867-4b29-90d7-bc3503d1aa25\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">engage in politics.</span></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\"> It uses innovative software and a network to help people understand </span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"1141c663-5341-44ad-ba0b-d2ebf45dac9f\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">complex </span></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">social issues and suggest solutions. </span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">The </span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"7b479ba0-9757-4efc-be95-02a4efd8b609\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">long-term goal</span></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\"> is a political environment </span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">where citizens' </span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"6583f13c-a25c-43bc-b4b6-eea072c2ea39\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">voices matter, </span></span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">leading to better responses for the common good. </span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"c68876b3-b512-4e1d-8b2d-e2b89df63552\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">Elected </span></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">officials, from the European Parliament to local governments, need to value these contributions in their decisions. </span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">The project also seeks to </span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"1a09ec20-050c-4064-9e98-dca3abb516e3\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">motivate </span></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">other organistations to embrace this approach and make citizen involvement a part of European democracy. </span></h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center; white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">Ultimately, it envisions a society where </span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-highlight\" data-text-attribute-id=\"fdb80ab4-04f8-4449-9f97-826b77bfe27b\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\">citizens feel empowered</span></span><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--white\"> to influence politics and shape their communities.</span></h4></div>",
